.playwright-mcp/

# `.dogfood.toml` is deliberately not ignored. It is the DOGFOOD 2026 acceptance
# configuration (routes, claimed tiers, deterministic demo session cookies for
# synthetic fixture data), it is a tracked file, and the Dockerfile copies it into
# the image. Hosted builders such as Render start from a clone of this repository,
# so anything ignored here is simply absent from the build context and
# `COPY ... .dogfood.toml ./` fails.
